<section class="bl-s bl-wr" id="water"><div class="bl-w"><div class="bl-sh"><p class="bl-mono">[ tool 01 ]</p><h2 class="rv">Water rating decoder</h2><p class="bl-p">The number on a case back is a test pressure, not a diving depth. Pick the rating on your watch to see what it really means for daily life.</p></div>
<div class="bl-wr-g"><div class="bl-gauge"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="130" class="g-bg"/><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="130" class="g-fg" id="wr-arc"/><g class="g-tk"><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(0 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(15 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(30 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(45 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(60 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(75 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(90 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(105 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(120 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(135 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(150 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(165 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(180 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(195 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(210 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(225 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(240 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(255 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(270 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(285 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(300 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(315 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(330 150 150)"/><path d="M150 14v10" transform="rotate(345 150 150)"/></g></svg><div class="bl-gauge-c"><b id="wr-n">100</b><span id="wr-u">metres / 10 bar</span></div><div class="bl-wave" id="wr-wave" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
<div><div class="bl-rt" id="wr-r" role="group" aria-label="Water rating"><button type="button" data-v="0">Resistant</button><button type="button" data-v="1">30 m</button><button type="button" data-v="2">50 m</button><button type="button" data-v="3" class="on">100 m</button><button type="button" data-v="4">200 m</button><button type="button" data-v="5">300 m+</button></div><ul class="bl-act" id="wr-l" aria-live="polite"></ul><p class="bl-note" id="wr-n2"></p><figure class="bl-wr-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772638904306-25d535626a04?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=240&q=75" alt="a close-up of a stainless steel watch" width="620" height="240" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></div></section>

<section class="bl-s bl-mn" id="moon"><div class="bl-w bl-mn-g"><div><p class="bl-mono">[ tool 02 ]</p><h2 class="rv">Moonphase calculator</h2><p class="bl-p">A moonphase disc turns once every two lunar months. Choose a date to see the moon as your dial should show it, and how far a standard moonphase will drift over time.</p>
<label class="bl-lb" for="mn-d">Date</label><input type="date" id="mn-d" class="bl-in"><div class="bl-mn-b"><button type="button" id="mn-p" class="bl-btn bl-btn-s">&minus; 1 day</button><button type="button" id="mn-t" class="bl-btn bl-btn-s">Today</button><button type="button" id="mn-n" class="bl-btn bl-btn-s">+ 1 day</button></div>
<dl class="bl-mn-r" aria-live="polite"><div><dt>Phase</dt><dd id="mn-ph"></dd></div><div><dt>Moon age</dt><dd id="mn-ag"></dd></div><div><dt>Lit</dt><dd id="mn-il"></dd></div></dl>
<label class="bl-lb" for="mn-ty">Your moonphase module</label><select id="mn-ty" class="bl-in"><option value="29.5">Standard (59-tooth wheel)</option><option value="29.53">High precision (135-tooth wheel)</option></select><p class="bl-note" id="mn-dr"></p></div>
